Counting anagrams of `abc` in `cbaebabacd`:

```python
need = [0] * 26
have = [0] * 26
for ch in p:
    need[ord(ch) - 97] += 1
count = 0
for i, ch in enumerate(s):
    have[ord(ch) - 97] += 1              # entering
    if i >= len(p):
        have[ord(s[i - len(p)]) - 97] -= 1   # leaving
    if i >= len(p) - 1 and have == need:
        count += 1
```

